 "note": "TRIAL (2026-11-18), the everyday cut from the accepted stance stand_sword_j6 and back to it (second take). From the wind (old t130) to the end of the follow (old t440) it is sword_cut exactly, 140 ms later. Start: a sink with the sword drawn lower behind, little steps in, the sword rising clockwise behind the back into the wind. Return: a recoil on planted feet with the blade carried on down past the near leg, the free arm swung down behind the back and forward, a bound back home (travel only while both feet are up), a landing that sinks past the stance with the sword swinging past its rest, then the stance (the last frame is stand_sword_j6@0). Made by art/redo/stand/mktrial_j.py.",
